{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"起初有一种突然涌起的郑重和迫切，甚至带着一点激动；随后渐渐柔和下来，变得细腻、谨慎。期待仍然很真切，却有些悬着，并不完全安心。\",\n  \"thread\": \"他是真的很想得到某种珍贵的东西，所以一开始几乎毫无保留地投入了期待。可是，自己如此向往，并不等于它已经属于自己。正因为这份期待很珍贵，那阵激动过后，他反而变得小心：既舍不得放下，又还没有什么能让他放心。那份温柔不是热情减退，而是很想要、又尚未得到时的珍惜。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他已经有了一份强烈而郑重的向往，无法把它当作可有可无的事情。\",\n    \"这份向往尚未得到实际的满足，因此热切、珍惜与不安可以同时存在。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e031a379-e274-4524-8656-89fc17937220", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215609089680Z", "elapsed_seconds": 127.687, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:58:16.784424+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cc952e29f4c3f3e5e45951f39eabbb75408e1ddf9a424a0c58d14e86553f21ba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "scre